(RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position Embedding) Tj
T*
(Rotary Position Embedding) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Absolute position embedding commonly adds p_i to x_i before projection:) Tj
T*
(    f_t\(x_i, i\) := W_t \(x_i + p_i\), t in {q, k, v}.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RoFormer instead incorporates position by rotating query and key vectors.) Tj
T*
(For a two-dimensional subspace:) Tj
T*
(    f_q\(x_m, m\) = R\(m theta\) W_q x_m) Tj
T*
(    f_k\(x_n, n\) = R\(n theta\) W_k x_n) Tj
T*
(where R\(phi\) is [[cos phi, -sin phi], [sin phi, cos phi]].) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The resulting dot product depends on relative phase \(m - n\) theta.) Tj
T*
(For higher dimensions, independent 2D subspaces use frequencies theta_i.) Tj
T*
(Equivalently, adjacent real coordinates form complex components multiplied) Tj
T*
(by exp\(i m theta_i\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(During incremental decoding, m is the absolute token index.) Tj
ET
